WEBVTT

01:38.009 --> 01:40.720
[Fate Chooses You]

01:41.390 --> 01:43.650
[Episode 40]

01:45.000 --> 01:46.460
Disciples of Xin Xie Manor

01:46.509 --> 01:47.970
are really unreasonable.

01:49.150 --> 01:50.410
But not to mention you,

01:51.070 --> 01:53.479
if I were given this task
of finding a needle in a haystack,

01:53.479 --> 01:54.120
I wouldn't have time

01:54.120 --> 01:55.310
for this either.

01:57.000 --> 01:57.950
What do you mean?

01:59.229 --> 02:00.360
Looking for a person

02:01.280 --> 02:02.510
in the vast crowd.

02:03.560 --> 02:05.070
You know I'm looking for someone?

02:05.070 --> 02:07.330
Not only do I know who you're looking for,

02:07.480 --> 02:08.280
but I also know

02:08.710 --> 02:09.370
where he is.

02:10.310 --> 02:11.150
Where is he?

02:21.840 --> 02:22.900
How much did you say

02:23.520 --> 02:25.190
that fish cost again?

02:25.710 --> 02:26.750
Seven hundred taels.

02:26.750 --> 02:28.430
I'll scrape together some money
to pay you back.

02:28.430 --> 02:29.160
Is that okay?

02:30.470 --> 02:31.930
That was the price before.

02:32.240 --> 02:32.910
Now,

02:33.800 --> 02:34.730
it's different.

02:39.360 --> 02:40.079
So what will it take

02:40.079 --> 02:41.680
for you to tell me where he is?

02:41.840 --> 02:43.040
As long as you tell me,

02:43.150 --> 02:44.150
I'll do anything.

02:46.400 --> 02:47.150
Anything?

02:48.079 --> 02:48.710
Anything.

02:51.350 --> 02:52.079
I'm thirsty.

03:09.680 --> 03:11.140
I told you there were fish.

03:11.560 --> 03:12.690
And it took the bait.

03:14.870 --> 03:16.200
Where is my fish basket?

03:30.840 --> 03:32.840
What is so good about that War Demon?

03:32.960 --> 03:34.490
Why does a nice girl like you

03:34.680 --> 03:35.810
have to look for him?

03:38.560 --> 03:39.490
Just say it, sir.

03:39.710 --> 03:41.310
What else do you want me to do?

03:42.120 --> 03:43.280
There's no more.

03:43.870 --> 03:44.520
However,

03:45.150 --> 03:46.550
I have one more question.

03:46.840 --> 03:47.570
I'm all ears.

03:50.840 --> 03:52.700
You have been to the divine realm?

03:53.000 --> 03:54.000
Who told you that?

03:54.120 --> 03:55.450
Do not worry about that.

03:56.079 --> 03:57.079
I have been there.

03:57.470 --> 03:59.200
I want to ask you about someone.

03:59.310 --> 03:59.910
Who is it?

04:01.120 --> 04:01.720
A goddess.

04:02.400 --> 04:03.190
A goddess?

04:04.120 --> 04:05.350
What is her name?

04:07.630 --> 04:08.360
I don't know.

04:09.280 --> 04:10.880
Then what is her position?

04:11.080 --> 04:12.680
Is she worshipped anywhere?

04:12.750 --> 04:14.150
I do not know that either.

04:14.640 --> 04:15.750
You don't know anything about her.

04:15.750 --> 04:17.480
How am I supposed to ask around?

04:18.310 --> 04:19.950
To be remembered by you,

04:20.339 --> 04:22.470
she must have some distinct features.

04:24.560 --> 04:25.560
She's beautiful.

04:25.630 --> 04:26.510
She's beautiful?

04:26.510 --> 04:27.000
Yes.

04:27.510 --> 04:28.770
Extremely beautiful.

04:29.360 --> 04:31.390
There are many beautiful girls
in this world.

04:31.390 --> 04:32.600
Those who can become goddesses

04:32.600 --> 04:34.240
are all graceful and outstanding.

04:34.240 --> 04:36.640
How is being beautiful a distinct feature?

04:38.159 --> 04:38.800
Her beauty

04:39.830 --> 04:40.890
is unforgettable.

04:42.040 --> 04:43.100
If you had seen her,

04:43.270 --> 04:45.070
you would definitely remember.

04:45.600 --> 04:46.870
No matter how beautiful she is,

04:46.870 --> 04:48.600
I definitely have not seen her.

04:49.000 --> 04:50.000
Let me put it this way.

04:50.000 --> 04:51.040
I have been to the divine realm,

04:51.040 --> 04:51.870
but I only stayed there

04:51.870 --> 04:53.070
for less than an hour.

04:53.800 --> 04:54.860
I met a fairy child,

04:54.920 --> 04:56.159
chatted with him for a little while,

04:56.159 --> 04:57.159
and then came down.

04:57.159 --> 04:58.560
You didn't see anyone else?

04:58.560 --> 04:59.040
No.

05:07.600 --> 05:08.190
Alright.

05:08.630 --> 05:10.290
I've answered your question.

05:10.600 --> 05:11.750
Now can you tell me

05:12.120 --> 05:13.320
where Lu Qianqiao is?

05:22.720 --> 05:25.180
Don't tell me
you're going back on your word.

05:28.070 --> 05:29.600
Why are you looking for him?

05:29.750 --> 05:30.480
You like him?

05:30.750 --> 05:31.310
I...

05:33.360 --> 05:34.690
How much do you like him?

05:35.360 --> 05:36.240
I...

05:36.920 --> 05:37.800
like him a lot.

05:38.430 --> 05:39.290
I only like him.

05:40.120 --> 05:41.450
If you catch up with him,

05:41.510 --> 05:42.770
and he runs away again,

05:43.000 --> 05:43.930
what will you do?

05:44.800 --> 05:46.270
It's not like he hasn't run before.

05:46.270 --> 05:47.730
I'll just chase him again.

05:48.600 --> 05:49.070
Not bad.

05:49.830 --> 05:50.960
You have some sense.

05:52.190 --> 05:53.830
War Demons are all rigid

05:54.390 --> 05:55.190
and stubborn.

05:55.510 --> 05:56.920
If you want to catch up with him,

05:56.920 --> 05:58.630
you must be more stubborn than him.

05:58.630 --> 05:59.750
Once you catch up with him,

05:59.750 --> 06:01.190
pester him relentlessly,

06:01.190 --> 06:02.190
and never give up.

06:02.870 --> 06:03.470
Remember,

06:03.870 --> 06:05.430
you must be thick-skinned.

06:06.920 --> 06:08.050
You're quite right.

06:08.270 --> 06:08.870
He

06:09.040 --> 06:10.300
always falls for that.

06:10.430 --> 06:11.190
And then?

06:12.190 --> 06:12.990
There's more?

06:14.160 --> 06:14.950
And then,

06:15.430 --> 06:16.510
find a good place.

06:17.430 --> 06:18.270
Like

06:18.680 --> 06:19.950
a deserted island

06:20.430 --> 06:22.290
or deep mountains with no people.

06:22.830 --> 06:24.270
Take him there to stay,

06:24.680 --> 06:26.000
live in seclusion from then on,

06:26.000 --> 06:28.260
and spend the rest of your lives in peace.

06:28.950 --> 06:30.310
Sounds good.

06:35.070 --> 06:35.730
Never mind.

06:36.680 --> 06:38.390
About you releasing my fish this time,

06:38.390 --> 06:39.320
let's forget it.

06:39.720 --> 06:40.320
Remember,

06:40.920 --> 06:41.600
you must take him

06:41.600 --> 06:42.830
to a good place,

06:43.310 --> 06:44.510
live in seclusion,

06:44.800 --> 06:47.060
and spend the rest of your lives in peace.

06:47.120 --> 06:48.850
Just don't ruin my plans again.

06:52.480 --> 06:53.159
You...

06:54.480 --> 06:56.210
aren't in good health, are you?

06:57.000 --> 06:58.950
I devoted myself to the Dao for years

06:58.950 --> 07:00.750
and recently came out of seclusion.

07:00.750 --> 07:02.350
I'm a bit unaccustomed to it.

07:02.870 --> 07:03.290
Well...

07:03.290 --> 07:04.730
You should rest more.

07:12.270 --> 07:13.600
Is there anything else?

07:15.040 --> 07:15.630
No.

07:16.000 --> 07:17.160
You haven't told me

07:17.270 --> 07:18.240
where he is.

07:20.660 --> 07:21.870
I heard the War Demons'

07:21.870 --> 07:23.330
5 curses have been broken.

07:24.000 --> 07:24.720
Now, he

07:25.270 --> 07:26.800
should be able to see colors

07:27.120 --> 07:28.580
and taste flavors, right?

07:31.040 --> 07:32.040
I also heard

07:32.680 --> 07:33.630
that at Zuixian Restaurant in the capital,

07:33.630 --> 07:35.159
there's a gluttonous diner

07:35.560 --> 07:36.890
who likes to eat sweets.

07:36.920 --> 07:38.510
He has been eating there
for almost half a month

07:38.510 --> 07:40.240
and still hasn't tired of them.

07:43.510 --> 07:44.070
I see.

07:45.040 --> 07:45.560
Thanks.

07:46.390 --> 07:47.000
Thank you.

07:52.070 --> 07:54.040
You are a really good person, sir.

07:57.390 --> 08:00.120
And the golden ring on your neck

08:00.480 --> 08:01.540
looks pretty nice.

08:06.800 --> 08:07.800
I'll be going now.

08:22.550 --> 08:25.220
[Zi Fei, Youhu Clan]

08:52.480 --> 08:53.480
Does it look nice?

08:54.390 --> 08:55.510
If your power hadn't been

08:55.510 --> 08:56.720
confined by this thing,

08:56.720 --> 08:57.390
we wouldn't have had to

08:57.390 --> 08:58.670
go to so much trouble.

09:01.150 --> 09:02.630
Do you think that person just now

09:02.630 --> 09:04.230
can lure the War Demons away?

09:05.510 --> 09:06.320
I think so.

09:10.390 --> 09:11.150
We planned for years

09:11.150 --> 09:12.550
and prepared a good show,

09:13.120 --> 09:14.980
only for them to ruin it like this.

09:16.150 --> 09:16.840
What a pity.

09:37.380 --> 09:41.470
[Sacred seed of the Jianmu Tree]

09:45.550 --> 09:46.550
I already told you

09:46.750 --> 09:48.610
Li Mofu won't amount to anything.

09:48.790 --> 09:49.510
Humans

09:50.150 --> 09:51.080
are the weakest,

09:51.840 --> 09:52.900
yet the greediest.

09:53.150 --> 09:54.150
They want to be ruthless

09:54.150 --> 09:55.610
and achieve a great thing,

09:55.720 --> 09:57.320
and they also want to frame it

09:57.320 --> 09:58.960
as great benevolence and righteousness,

09:58.960 --> 10:00.120
trying to gain the world's understanding

10:00.120 --> 10:00.780
and praise.

10:02.000 --> 10:03.120
They want everything,

10:03.120 --> 10:04.450
but end up with nothing.

10:04.630 --> 10:05.390
They wasted

10:05.390 --> 10:08.050
your sacred seed of the Jianmu Tree
for nothing.

10:10.510 --> 10:11.200
However,

10:12.200 --> 10:14.660
we didn't go to all that trouble
for nothing.

10:14.960 --> 10:16.120
At least we know now

10:16.790 --> 10:17.850
that in this world,

10:17.870 --> 10:19.470
there is a Perfect War Demon.

10:20.630 --> 10:22.560
So what if he's a Perfect War Demon?

10:22.870 --> 10:23.630
Isn't he still

10:23.630 --> 10:24.690
tied down by a woman

10:25.390 --> 10:26.790
from the immortal sects?

10:27.600 --> 10:29.850
This is called everything has its match.

10:29.850 --> 10:30.790
That woman from the immortal sect

10:30.790 --> 10:32.450
can keep Lu Qianqiao in check.

10:33.320 --> 10:34.450
Maybe in the future,

10:35.030 --> 10:35.670
you'll also meet someone

10:35.670 --> 10:37.070
who can keep you in check.

10:38.550 --> 10:39.480
Keep me in check?

10:41.670 --> 10:42.550
That person

10:43.200 --> 10:44.400
hasn't been born yet.

11:11.790 --> 11:13.620
[Zuixian Restaurant]

11:50.600 --> 11:51.390
Enjoy, sir.

11:53.440 --> 11:53.910
Miss,

11:54.240 --> 11:55.700
what would you like to eat?

11:56.320 --> 11:57.200
I'm looking for someone,

11:57.200 --> 11:57.910
a man.

11:58.240 --> 11:59.240
He looks about

11:59.240 --> 12:00.240
32 or 33 years old,

12:00.320 --> 12:01.180
very handsome,

12:01.480 --> 12:02.480
and likes sweets.

12:04.550 --> 12:05.030
Miss,

12:05.240 --> 12:06.040
as you can see,

12:06.790 --> 12:08.270
our restaurant is so famous.

12:08.270 --> 12:09.360
With so many guests coming and going

12:09.360 --> 12:10.150
every day,

12:11.000 --> 12:11.720
I really can't remember

12:11.720 --> 12:12.780
the guests' faces.

12:14.120 --> 12:15.960
He booked the whole place a few days ago.

12:15.960 --> 12:17.890
Please try to remember carefully.

12:19.270 --> 12:20.600
Booked the whole place?

12:25.150 --> 12:26.510
There was such a person, I think.

12:26.510 --> 12:27.720
He was quite handsome,

12:27.720 --> 12:28.520
but very cold.

12:28.870 --> 12:30.150
He came to eat at 7 PM every day.

12:30.150 --> 12:31.390
He only tried 5 dishes every time,

12:31.390 --> 12:32.360
preferred not to be disturbed,

12:32.360 --> 12:33.690
and didn't like to talk.

12:34.270 --> 12:35.360
Yes, that's him.

12:35.840 --> 12:36.510
Where is he?

12:37.030 --> 12:37.510
He left.

12:38.240 --> 12:39.000
He left?

12:39.630 --> 12:40.490
Where did he go?

12:41.600 --> 12:42.630
That I don't know.

12:42.790 --> 12:44.670
He only booked the place for half a month.

12:44.670 --> 12:45.790
By my reckoning,

12:46.600 --> 12:47.910
he hasn't been here for 3 days.

12:47.910 --> 12:50.440
He might have left the capital
a long time ago.

12:58.440 --> 12:59.670
Come and take a look.

12:59.670 --> 13:00.750
All homemade.

13:00.840 --> 13:01.270
Miss.

13:01.270 --> 13:01.840
Sir.

13:02.720 --> 13:04.120
-This...
-You want some?

13:05.750 --> 13:06.720
I'd like one.

13:10.150 --> 13:11.360
Come and take a look.

13:12.030 --> 13:13.150
Little pendants,

13:13.440 --> 13:14.440
little trinkets.

13:15.510 --> 13:16.320
Take a look.

13:17.320 --> 13:17.980
Here you go.

13:27.840 --> 13:29.080
Little pendants,

13:29.240 --> 13:30.600
little trinkets here.

13:31.120 --> 13:32.150
Take a look.

13:33.960 --> 13:35.120
Little pendants!

13:38.200 --> 13:41.520
[Mr. Qi]

13:50.030 --> 13:51.090
What are you doing?

13:52.480 --> 13:53.080
Painting.

13:54.030 --> 13:56.090
Did I give you permission to paint me?

13:56.320 --> 13:57.200
You are quite

13:57.240 --> 13:58.000
a funny girl.

13:58.870 --> 14:00.510
How do you know the woman in my painting

14:00.510 --> 14:01.200
is you?

14:02.750 --> 14:03.410
Take a look.

14:05.270 --> 14:06.870
The woman in my painting

14:07.240 --> 14:09.200
has a mole near her eye.

14:11.440 --> 14:11.910
Miss,

14:12.270 --> 14:13.070
do you have it?

14:13.270 --> 14:13.720
You...

14:20.390 --> 14:22.320
You're very good at painting, huh?

14:22.670 --> 14:23.960
I just make a living

14:23.960 --> 14:25.030
with this craft.

14:27.080 --> 14:27.680
Well then,

14:27.790 --> 14:28.550
can you paint a portrait

14:28.550 --> 14:29.390
for me?

14:30.440 --> 14:31.320
I could,

14:31.670 --> 14:32.430
but

14:33.030 --> 14:34.630
my fee is quite high.

14:38.720 --> 14:39.450
That's fine.

14:40.150 --> 14:40.880
I have money.

14:41.390 --> 14:41.960
Alright.

14:42.840 --> 14:43.300
Come on.

14:44.000 --> 14:44.550
Tell me,

14:44.750 --> 14:45.750
who am I painting?

14:45.750 --> 14:46.610
Call them over.

14:48.390 --> 14:49.720
I don't know where he is.

14:53.320 --> 14:55.080
So you can't find him.

14:55.320 --> 14:57.520
That's why you're taking your anger out

14:57.750 --> 14:59.910
on an innocent painter.

15:03.910 --> 15:05.570
I didn't say I wouldn't paint.

15:12.630 --> 15:13.080
Sit.

15:18.390 --> 15:19.270
Describe him.

15:19.870 --> 15:21.680
He is very tall and thin.

15:22.150 --> 15:23.080
As for his looks,

15:23.720 --> 15:24.920
he is well-featured,

15:25.440 --> 15:26.600
and quite handsome.

15:49.030 --> 15:50.630
He has prominent brow bones,

15:50.750 --> 15:51.880
and a straight nose.

15:52.960 --> 15:53.720
He seems a bit

15:53.720 --> 15:54.750
unapproachable.

15:56.000 --> 15:57.750
But once you get to know him,

15:58.150 --> 16:00.350
you'll find he's actually very gentle.

16:00.910 --> 16:03.360
Like a frozen pool,

16:04.000 --> 16:04.730
when warmed,

16:05.240 --> 16:07.100
it turns into a trickling stream.

16:09.630 --> 16:10.890
He likes painting a lot

16:11.670 --> 16:13.470
and is very quiet when he paints.

16:14.870 --> 16:15.550
I think

16:15.910 --> 16:18.570
the saying
"a modest gentleman, gentle as jade"

16:19.240 --> 16:20.700
perfectly describes him.

16:25.200 --> 16:27.150
His smile is very gentle.

16:27.870 --> 16:28.910
His eyes are deep,

16:29.440 --> 16:31.030
like a boundless night sky

16:31.630 --> 16:33.750
filled with bright stars,

16:35.440 --> 16:36.200
brighter than

16:36.200 --> 16:37.360
any star

16:38.550 --> 16:39.410
I've ever seen.

16:50.790 --> 16:51.870
But when he fights,

16:52.080 --> 16:53.440
he's like a different person,

16:53.440 --> 16:54.640
fierce and ruthless.

16:55.000 --> 16:55.840
And his movements

16:55.840 --> 16:57.300
are very neat and stylish,

16:57.360 --> 16:58.870
like a martial hero.

17:01.120 --> 17:02.380
As long as he's around,

17:02.390 --> 17:04.000
any problem becomes simple.

17:04.680 --> 17:06.270
Even if the mountains collapse,

17:06.270 --> 17:07.730
or the seas flood the land,

17:07.960 --> 17:09.420
as long as I can look at him,

17:09.790 --> 17:11.000
I feel at peace.

17:12.450 --> 17:14.280
Feel at peace?

17:16.030 --> 17:17.480
Why did you stop painting?

17:17.480 --> 17:18.240
I can't do it.

17:18.680 --> 17:19.200
Why?

17:19.680 --> 17:20.200
Miss,

17:20.720 --> 17:22.180
look at your description.

17:22.349 --> 17:23.950
Does this sound like a human?

17:25.400 --> 17:27.000
Are we still doing this or not?

17:27.000 --> 17:27.720
We are.

17:28.270 --> 17:30.030
Then here's what we are going to do.

17:30.030 --> 17:30.560
I'll ask,

17:30.960 --> 17:31.820
and you answer.

17:34.200 --> 17:35.460
What's his face shape?

17:36.070 --> 17:37.000
Square or round?

17:37.240 --> 17:38.000
Long or flat?

17:38.480 --> 17:39.720
I guess it's round,

17:40.240 --> 17:41.240
but not entirely.

17:41.590 --> 17:43.160
His features are sharp.

17:43.480 --> 17:44.880
His cheeks are a bit thin.

17:45.030 --> 17:46.090
His lips are thick.

17:46.680 --> 17:48.400
His smile is warm

17:48.720 --> 17:49.520
and friendly.

17:50.480 --> 17:51.610
What about his eyes?

17:51.920 --> 17:53.030
Almond eyes, phoenix eyes,

17:53.030 --> 17:54.290
or peach blossom eyes?

17:55.550 --> 17:57.750
They are almond eyes when he's relaxed.

17:58.440 --> 18:00.640
They look sharp when he stares.

18:01.510 --> 18:02.680
When he frowns,

18:03.110 --> 18:05.170
he looks affectionate and reserved.

18:37.750 --> 18:39.550
I think I've seen this man before.

18:39.550 --> 18:40.160
You have?

18:40.640 --> 18:41.400
Where?

18:43.030 --> 18:45.030
I think I've seen him.

18:47.000 --> 18:49.070
In this restaurant across the street.

18:49.070 --> 18:50.330
He was drinking there.

18:52.480 --> 18:52.960
Miss,

18:53.480 --> 18:54.920
let me give you some advice.

18:54.920 --> 18:56.680
Stay in the city today.

18:57.350 --> 18:58.750
There's a lantern festival tonight.

18:58.750 --> 19:00.030
If he's in the city,

19:00.160 --> 19:02.350
he'll surely join the fun.

19:04.440 --> 19:05.720
I will definitely stay.

19:05.720 --> 19:07.320
There is a lantern festival?

19:09.510 --> 19:10.070
Take it.

19:19.940 --> 19:23.460
[Yonghua Gate]

20:17.030 --> 20:18.790
Come take a look!

20:19.400 --> 20:19.830
Miss,

20:19.830 --> 20:21.030
would you like to buy a mask?

20:21.030 --> 20:21.690
Take a look.

20:22.790 --> 20:24.550
Come take a look!

20:24.750 --> 20:25.680
Masks! Masks!

20:26.110 --> 20:27.790
Beautiful War Demon masks!

20:29.510 --> 20:30.000
Sir,

20:30.200 --> 20:31.160
would you like to buy a mask?

20:31.160 --> 20:31.820
No, thanks.

20:33.240 --> 20:33.680
Sir,

20:33.790 --> 20:34.550
did any catch your eye?

20:34.550 --> 20:35.210
No, thanks.

20:35.400 --> 20:36.530
Come on, take a look.

20:41.400 --> 20:41.830
Miss,

20:41.880 --> 20:43.140
see anything you like?

20:44.310 --> 20:46.160
Come and take a look!

20:49.790 --> 20:51.160
Here, try this.

20:51.310 --> 20:51.750
Okay.

20:52.510 --> 20:54.310
Miss, what would you like to eat?

20:54.590 --> 20:55.920
I'll have a bowl of flour tea

20:55.920 --> 20:57.380
and a plate of sweet cakes.

20:57.750 --> 20:58.880
I'm terribly sorry.

20:58.920 --> 21:00.520
The sweet cakes are sold out.

21:01.240 --> 21:02.000
Sold out?

21:02.200 --> 21:02.680
Yes.

21:02.830 --> 21:04.290
A customer came by just now

21:04.400 --> 21:05.640
and bought all the sweet cakes

21:05.640 --> 21:06.550
in my shop.

21:07.240 --> 21:08.440
Looking at his build,

21:08.640 --> 21:10.510
he didn't look like a big eater.

21:12.270 --> 21:12.790
Sir,

21:13.070 --> 21:14.270
what did he look like?

21:14.960 --> 21:15.880
I was busy

21:15.880 --> 21:16.940
packing his order,

21:17.000 --> 21:18.400
so I didn't look closely.

21:18.590 --> 21:19.450
I only remember

21:19.480 --> 21:20.720
he looked travel-worn,

21:20.720 --> 21:22.640
like a traveler from far away.

21:26.750 --> 21:27.680
Then take a look.

21:29.270 --> 21:30.730
Does he look like this man?

21:32.750 --> 21:34.680
Their builds are very similar.

21:35.510 --> 21:36.400
Where did he go?

21:37.550 --> 21:39.150
He went that way, I remember.

21:40.960 --> 21:41.820
Thank you, sir.

21:41.960 --> 21:42.890
You're welcome.

21:47.920 --> 21:51.510
Sachets! Sachets!

21:48.560 --> 21:53.400
♪ Spending a lifetime,
I ask myself what I first sought ♪

21:52.750 --> 21:53.480
Lu Qianqiao,

21:54.480 --> 21:55.440
if one day—

21:54.580 --> 21:59.340
♪ What is it my heart truly desires? ♪

21:55.790 --> 21:56.640
I mean if—

21:57.720 --> 21:59.560
you were also affected
by Ghost Covering Eyes,

21:59.560 --> 22:02.550
♪ Step by step up the immortal stairway ♪

22:00.030 --> 22:00.590
would you completely

22:00.590 --> 22:01.510
forget about me

22:01.720 --> 22:02.970
and not remember me at all?

22:02.970 --> 22:05.720
♪ Paved with countless lost souls ♪

22:03.400 --> 22:04.790
How could that happen?

22:05.640 --> 22:06.310
What if?

22:06.010 --> 22:11.950
♪ Who would dare destroy the ladder
to immortality and end the path? ♪

22:07.240 --> 22:08.400
What if?

22:08.680 --> 22:10.080
If that day really comes,

22:10.310 --> 22:11.310
I will go find you,

22:12.290 --> 22:17.250
♪ The sun blazes over the earth ♪

22:12.400 --> 22:15.000
and we'll get to know each other
all over again.

22:17.830 --> 22:18.400
Sorry.

22:18.270 --> 22:23.300
♪ Yet it cannot warm
every cold home below ♪

22:23.330 --> 22:26.930
♪ I've heard cries that rend the heavens ♪

22:24.440 --> 22:25.040
Excuse me.

22:26.350 --> 22:27.080
This person—

22:27.080 --> 22:29.900
♪ I hear the shame of parting ♪

22:27.200 --> 22:28.200
have you seen him?

22:28.550 --> 22:29.400
No, I haven't.

22:29.920 --> 22:32.480
♪ This immortal path admired by all ♪

22:32.510 --> 22:35.390
♪ Can exist, or not exist ♪

22:35.410 --> 22:38.070
♪ Once again I see
the world's cold indifference ♪

22:38.090 --> 22:41.340
♪ Bending everyone's spine ♪

22:41.360 --> 22:46.710
♪ Illusions and vanity blind the eyes,
how could one still care ♪

22:42.240 --> 22:43.760
Lu Qianqiao!

22:47.360 --> 22:50.260
♪ Don't think I'm ridiculous and foolish ♪

22:50.070 --> 22:52.070
Catch him! He's a War Demon!

22:50.430 --> 22:53.090
♪ My solitary voice
will echo through the valley ♪

22:52.110 --> 22:52.830
Catch him!

22:53.280 --> 22:56.190
♪ They speak of immortal grace
and mystic arts ♪

22:53.310 --> 22:54.070
Catch him!

22:56.210 --> 22:59.200
♪ Is there still a trace
of compassion? ♪

22:59.400 --> 23:02.140
♪ Realize my heart
seeks no personal gain ♪

22:59.440 --> 23:00.110
Hurry up!

23:00.200 --> 23:00.880
Catch him!

23:00.920 --> 23:01.920
Stop right there!

23:02.320 --> 23:05.250
♪ Realize my hands
remain unstained by blood ♪

23:05.280 --> 23:11.270
♪ Realize this life still,
as always, pursues the Dao ♪

23:09.720 --> 23:10.680
So beautiful!

23:13.630 --> 23:16.300
♪ Having seen the widespread devastation ♪

23:16.630 --> 23:19.620
♪ How could I look on and ignore it? ♪

23:20.200 --> 23:22.380
♪ I do not fear returning to dust ♪

23:22.400 --> 23:25.760
♪ I walk this path alone ♪

23:25.790 --> 23:28.570
♪ To let all walk ♪

23:28.590 --> 23:31.520
♪ The road to immortality ♪

23:31.660 --> 23:38.210
♪ I fear not defying
immortal laws and sacred precepts ♪

23:38.240 --> 23:41.850
♪ Let sin be punished,
let desire be destroyed ♪

23:39.000 --> 23:40.350
Lanterns!

23:40.480 --> 23:42.000
Beautiful lanterns!

23:42.670 --> 23:49.630
♪ Yet the heart must never be forsaken ♪

23:44.640 --> 23:45.310
Be careful!

23:48.310 --> 23:49.000
Look!

23:49.310 --> 23:50.440
This person is so amazing!

23:50.440 --> 23:51.840
She must be a cultivator.

23:59.920 --> 24:01.200
What a coincidence, miss.

24:01.200 --> 24:02.000
We meet again.

24:04.960 --> 24:06.420
Judging by your reaction,

24:06.510 --> 24:07.310
I'm afraid you haven't found

24:07.310 --> 24:08.720
the person you're looking for

24:08.720 --> 24:09.520
and mistook me

24:10.200 --> 24:11.070
for him.

24:17.830 --> 24:18.890
Why are you crying?

24:20.200 --> 24:20.880
No, I...

24:21.000 --> 24:22.110
I was just kidding.

24:24.270 --> 24:24.960
I

24:25.720 --> 24:27.450
hate seeing girls cry the most.

24:28.480 --> 24:30.140
I don't need you to comfort me.

24:35.350 --> 24:35.920
Sorry.

24:37.000 --> 24:37.750
Actually,

24:38.270 --> 24:39.110
I understand

24:39.340 --> 24:41.070
the pain of looking for someone.

24:41.070 --> 24:42.030
I don't need you to comfort me.

24:42.030 --> 24:42.880
I'm not.

24:43.440 --> 24:44.160
It's true.

24:45.920 --> 24:47.580
I'm also looking for someone.

24:48.310 --> 24:50.310
I've been looking for so many years,

24:50.960 --> 24:52.560
but still haven't found her.

24:55.720 --> 24:56.520
Can you drink?

24:57.640 --> 24:58.350
Why?

24:59.240 --> 25:00.840
We are in the same situation.

25:00.960 --> 25:03.510
Naturally, we should comfort
our sorrows with wine

25:03.510 --> 25:04.840
and get drunk together.

25:11.220 --> 25:13.730
[Zuixian Restaurant]

25:12.590 --> 25:13.520
Here's the wine.

25:16.160 --> 25:17.160
Our signature wine,

25:17.160 --> 25:18.560
"Never Returning Home."

25:19.960 --> 25:21.270
The name of this wine

25:21.680 --> 25:22.940
is quite interesting.

25:23.790 --> 25:25.350
Mr. Qi, you have a good eye.

25:26.440 --> 25:28.310
You know I'm Mr. Qi?

25:28.830 --> 25:29.640
Of course.

25:30.070 --> 25:30.960
Our wine

25:31.160 --> 25:32.160
is unparalleled.

25:32.750 --> 25:34.590
But good quality comes at a price.

25:34.590 --> 25:35.590
This fine wine

25:35.790 --> 25:36.990
costs 3 taels per jar.

25:39.640 --> 25:40.770
Three taels per jar?

25:42.000 --> 25:43.070
Don't worry about the money.

25:43.070 --> 25:44.030
Bring as much as you have.

25:44.030 --> 25:44.790
Alright!

25:46.070 --> 25:47.550
You're quite generous.

26:15.400 --> 26:16.660
Can you keep drinking?

26:17.160 --> 26:17.720
Yes.

26:18.200 --> 26:18.930
Let's drink.

26:19.110 --> 26:19.770
Keep going.

26:19.960 --> 26:21.110
You don't get drunk easily.

26:21.110 --> 26:22.910
You can really hold your liquor.

26:29.270 --> 26:30.130
Let me tell you.

26:31.110 --> 26:32.000
Actually,

26:32.640 --> 26:34.000
I'm not a good drinker.

26:34.790 --> 26:36.050
I can't hold my liquor.

26:36.720 --> 26:37.920
There's someone else

26:38.350 --> 26:39.240
who can.

26:40.830 --> 26:41.590
Let me guess.

26:43.110 --> 26:44.200
Could it be

26:44.750 --> 26:46.280
the one you're looking for?

26:47.680 --> 26:48.680
How do you know?

26:50.790 --> 26:52.350
Why don't you tell me

26:52.940 --> 26:55.330
what other characteristics he has

26:55.600 --> 26:56.550
besides being handsome

26:56.550 --> 26:57.510
and dashing?

26:58.160 --> 26:59.030
If one day

26:59.030 --> 26:59.880
I run into him,

27:00.550 --> 27:02.410
I'll definitely keep him for you.

27:02.960 --> 27:04.270
There are too many.

27:04.750 --> 27:05.350
I'll say,

27:05.640 --> 27:06.640
and you remember.

27:07.000 --> 27:07.860
I'll remember.

27:09.000 --> 27:09.680
He

27:10.510 --> 27:11.440
loves drinking,

27:11.960 --> 27:13.270
and he can hold his liquor.

27:13.270 --> 27:14.870
Even if he drinks all of this,

27:14.960 --> 27:16.020
he won't get drunk.

27:16.640 --> 27:18.240
And he loves delicious food,

27:18.640 --> 27:19.640
all kinds of them,

27:19.920 --> 27:21.160
especially sweets.

27:23.110 --> 27:25.850
He's a bit cold to strangers.

27:26.400 --> 27:28.750
But he's very nice to his friends.

27:29.270 --> 27:30.800
He's also good at painting.

27:30.960 --> 27:31.760
His paintings

27:32.070 --> 27:33.270
are much better than yours.

27:33.270 --> 27:34.270
Better than mine?

27:34.760 --> 27:36.680
He's also proficient in medicine.

27:36.680 --> 27:38.400
Anyway, there's nothing he can't do.

27:38.400 --> 27:40.400
He knows a little bit of everything.

28:08.590 --> 28:09.920
Have you remembered it?

28:10.830 --> 28:11.720
I have.

28:21.070 --> 28:21.790
Also...

28:23.680 --> 28:24.640
I like him.

28:26.160 --> 28:27.550
He used to like me too.

28:30.270 --> 28:32.270
We've been to many places together,

28:32.750 --> 28:35.000
from the Central Plains to North Xiang.

28:36.480 --> 28:39.010
We've eaten
lots of delicious food together,

28:39.250 --> 28:43.260
♪ Caught in fate's design,
I search my soul ♪

28:40.070 --> 28:41.930
watched many sunrises together,

28:43.640 --> 28:46.620
♪ What should I do to avoid
living my life in vain? ♪

28:43.680 --> 28:45.160
been outlaws together,

28:46.640 --> 28:48.030
and faced death together.

28:46.640 --> 28:48.360
♪ My blade stays clean,
untouched by dust ♪

28:48.390 --> 28:52.360
♪ Yet it's sparked thousands of wars ♪

28:49.880 --> 28:50.400
Senior.

28:50.830 --> 28:51.480
Senior!

28:51.960 --> 28:53.270
How do we get to the pantry

28:53.270 --> 28:54.270
at Li Ying Garden?

28:54.400 --> 28:57.450
♪ A towering tree worn down into
a blade devoid of feeling ♪

28:55.310 --> 28:56.510
I am Xin Mei from Xin Xie Manor.

28:56.510 --> 28:57.880
May I know your name, Senior?

28:57.880 --> 29:01.130
♪ The heart hides its root
at the bottom of the abyss ♪

28:59.070 --> 28:59.830
Lu Qianqiao.

29:00.350 --> 29:01.420
Qian as in thousands,

29:01.420 --> 29:07.320
♪ In red, I look at you
with a glimpse of shame ♪

29:01.510 --> 29:02.970
and Qiao as in arbor trees.

29:04.440 --> 29:06.000
Since you call me Senior,

29:06.440 --> 29:07.720
I won't let you die.

29:08.040 --> 29:11.840
♪ Being haunted by the spell,
even if it's cruel ♪

29:08.350 --> 29:10.110
Thank you for saving my life, Mr. Lu.

29:10.110 --> 29:11.840
I will never forget your favor.

29:12.240 --> 29:13.350
If you ever need help,

29:12.360 --> 29:15.200
♪ It's better than being trapped by fate ♪

29:13.440 --> 29:14.400
I'll come to your aid

29:14.400 --> 29:15.360
despite any danger.

29:15.360 --> 29:17.110
♪ Between gain and loss ♪

29:17.130 --> 29:21.340
♪ Lies a thousand years of grace ♪

29:17.240 --> 29:19.500
I don't need you to go through any danger.

29:19.750 --> 29:21.350
It'll save me a lot of trouble
if you could

29:21.350 --> 29:23.430
master the Fish Drinking Technique soon.

29:23.430 --> 29:26.460
♪ Even if it's soul-eroding,
extreme pain, I accept it all ♪

29:25.110 --> 29:26.840
What exactly should I call you?

29:27.160 --> 29:30.460
♪ Embracing pain as home,
reborn like a phoenix ♪

29:27.400 --> 29:29.680
Are you Lu Huai,
the magistrate of Wei County,

29:29.680 --> 29:31.270
or the Autumn Crimson Blade,
a hero from the martial world,

29:30.950 --> 29:37.010
♪ Just to trade the rest of my days
for one true life as a human ♪

29:31.790 --> 29:33.510
or Lu Qianqiao, a War Demon?

29:36.960 --> 29:37.750
Lu Qianqiao,

29:37.920 --> 29:41.570
♪ Let strong wine carry me into
drunken nights till midnight ♪

29:38.350 --> 29:40.080
you are a War Demon, aren't you?

29:41.590 --> 29:44.770
♪ Let my soul blaze in brilliant colors ♪

29:43.270 --> 29:43.920
Yes.

29:44.790 --> 29:47.590
♪ Let the agony of a thousand cuts ♪

29:45.000 --> 29:45.800
The War Demons

29:46.350 --> 29:47.270
are all evil.

29:47.610 --> 29:52.030
♪ Stand as proof that I have lived ♪

29:48.270 --> 29:49.920
You're a disciple of an immortal sect.

29:49.920 --> 29:51.650
I am a remnant of the War Demons.

29:52.270 --> 29:53.110
It's only natural

29:52.400 --> 29:56.150
♪ Let me taste a life of flesh and blood
in full ♪

29:53.640 --> 29:54.970
that you want to kill me.

29:56.180 --> 29:59.110
♪ Let me savor the many flavors
of the mortal world ♪

29:56.240 --> 29:57.500
But ask yourself this:

29:57.960 --> 29:59.220
have I ever harmed you?

29:59.480 --> 30:01.520
♪ Let me face the world's
warmth and cold alike ♪

29:59.550 --> 30:00.680
Have I ever hurt you?

30:01.310 --> 30:02.070
I promise,

30:01.540 --> 30:06.580
♪ To live and perish with it,
daring to go mad, daring to dream ♪

30:02.830 --> 30:04.400
though I am one of the War Demons,

30:04.400 --> 30:06.000
I don't want to be a War Demon.

30:06.590 --> 30:07.550
I only want to be human.

30:06.610 --> 30:10.620
♪ Let strong wine carry me into
drunken nights till midnight ♪

30:08.590 --> 30:09.440
For my wish,

30:10.030 --> 30:10.720
I shed my skin,

30:10.640 --> 30:13.800
♪ Let my soul blaze in brilliant colors ♪

30:11.000 --> 30:12.000
renewed my bones,

30:12.000 --> 30:13.200
and changed my flesh.

30:13.240 --> 30:14.550
Every time I succeed
at one of these things,

30:13.830 --> 30:16.640
♪ Let the agony of a thousand cuts ♪

30:15.270 --> 30:16.720
my cultivation
would decrease significantly.

30:16.660 --> 30:21.410
♪ Stand as proof that I have lived ♪

30:17.350 --> 30:18.590
But I'm still happy

30:19.590 --> 30:20.680
that I can see

30:20.680 --> 30:21.960
this colorful world,

30:21.560 --> 30:25.340
♪ Let me taste a life of flesh and blood
in full ♪

30:22.830 --> 30:24.160
and that I can feel pain.

30:25.110 --> 30:26.510
And this feeling makes me

30:25.360 --> 30:28.140
♪ Let me savor the many flavors
of the mortal world ♪

30:27.550 --> 30:29.000
feel truly alive.

30:28.450 --> 30:30.290
♪ Let me face the world's
warmth and cold alike ♪

30:30.320 --> 30:35.720
♪ To live and perish with it,
daring to go mad, daring to dream ♪

30:31.550 --> 30:33.080
Let's go back to Wei County.

30:33.270 --> 30:34.400
That's my hometown.

30:34.880 --> 30:36.070
You've lived there too.

30:35.750 --> 30:41.800
♪ Don't live in vain,
have a pleasant journey of life ♪

30:37.830 --> 30:38.640
You mean...

30:39.590 --> 30:40.270
you're willing to be a mortal

30:40.270 --> 30:41.240
with me

30:41.960 --> 30:43.070
and give up cultivating altogether?

30:43.070 --> 30:44.870
My Dao heart is unstable anyway.

30:45.160 --> 30:46.680
I probably won't achieve much

30:46.680 --> 30:48.280
on this path of cultivation.

30:49.480 --> 30:50.160
Xin Mei,

30:51.010 --> 30:51.640
thank you.

30:52.720 --> 30:53.680
Thank you.

30:59.330 --> 31:00.330
Then why did he

31:01.070 --> 31:02.110
leave you behind

31:02.830 --> 31:03.720
and go alone?

31:06.440 --> 31:07.900
He didn't leave me behind.

31:08.400 --> 31:10.000
Something happened later,

31:12.000 --> 31:12.930
and he forgot me.

31:14.200 --> 31:15.240
Lu Qianqiao...

31:19.720 --> 31:21.550
Lu Qianqiao!

31:23.440 --> 31:24.880
Lu Qianqiao!

31:27.960 --> 31:30.110
Lu Qianqiao, don't go!

31:30.400 --> 31:32.430
I'm Xin Mei! Come back!

31:33.920 --> 31:35.920
Lu Qianqiao!

31:37.110 --> 31:38.070
No!

31:49.070 --> 31:50.200
But I will remember.

31:52.310 --> 31:53.640
I will always remember.

31:54.550 --> 31:55.640
I remember he said

31:56.270 --> 31:57.440
he wanted
to go to the most expensive restaurant

31:57.440 --> 31:58.440
in the capital...

31:58.680 --> 32:00.080
Taste the finest dishes,

32:00.160 --> 32:01.620
drink the strongest wine,

32:01.790 --> 32:03.050
get completely drunk,

32:03.240 --> 32:04.440
and have a good sleep.

32:05.660 --> 32:06.400
I'll remember

32:06.400 --> 32:08.160
every promise I made to him

32:08.680 --> 32:09.880
and every word I said.

32:11.270 --> 32:11.880
Then,

32:13.400 --> 32:14.640
I will find him.

32:17.310 --> 32:18.840
I will definitely find him.

32:22.510 --> 32:23.370
Definitely...

32:33.680 --> 32:34.750
I definitely will.

32:41.240 --> 32:42.440
Finding someone

32:43.200 --> 32:44.730
in the vast sea of people...

32:46.350 --> 32:47.590
is no easy task.

32:49.680 --> 32:51.030
Where on earth is she?

33:29.680 --> 33:30.200
Miss,

33:30.550 --> 33:31.350
you're awake?

33:31.590 --> 33:33.160
You ordered so many jars of wine
last night.

33:33.160 --> 33:34.270
I thought you had a great tolerance,

33:34.270 --> 33:36.600
but you slept straight through till dawn.

33:36.640 --> 33:37.750
Excuse me, where is

33:37.750 --> 33:39.480
the gentleman who came with me?

33:39.480 --> 33:40.110
He left.

33:41.240 --> 33:42.100
Check, please.

33:42.350 --> 33:44.010
That gentleman already paid.

33:44.030 --> 33:44.630
Oh, right.

33:44.890 --> 33:45.790
The gentleman said

33:45.790 --> 33:46.440
your painting

33:46.440 --> 33:47.990
was soaked in wine last night.

33:47.990 --> 33:49.320
He left a new one for you.

33:59.480 --> 34:00.080
Oh, right.

34:00.350 --> 34:02.480
Could you tell me how to get to the pier?

34:02.830 --> 34:04.510
Why don't you believe me?

34:05.550 --> 34:06.270
That Crazy Taoist's reading

34:06.270 --> 34:07.400
was wrong.

34:08.070 --> 34:09.550
People born on September 9th

34:09.550 --> 34:10.840
are not the Heavenly Talent.

34:10.840 --> 34:12.570
People born on August 16th are.

34:12.630 --> 34:13.230
You know?

34:13.800 --> 34:15.199
See? What a coincidence.

34:15.230 --> 34:16.960
It happens to be your birthday.

34:20.000 --> 34:21.070
I see that your

34:21.590 --> 34:22.400
forehead

34:22.510 --> 34:23.510
is long and full,

34:23.750 --> 34:24.840
broad and wide.

34:25.190 --> 34:26.360
This is clearly the face

34:26.360 --> 34:28.960
of a capable person
with great wealth and honor.

34:28.960 --> 34:29.820
Let me tell you,

34:29.820 --> 34:31.420
if you go to Lingji Mountain,

34:31.760 --> 34:34.670
you will definitely ascend
to godhood in the future.

34:34.670 --> 34:35.360
You know?

34:38.239 --> 34:39.100
How about this?

34:39.190 --> 34:40.320
I won't ask for much.

34:40.760 --> 34:42.510
Just give me 5 taels of silver,

34:42.800 --> 34:44.360
and I'll write you a recommendation letter

34:44.360 --> 34:46.230
to cultivate immortality
at Lingji Mountain.

34:46.230 --> 34:46.960
Sounds good?

34:46.960 --> 34:47.760
I'm not going.

34:48.710 --> 34:50.590
You have a natural Daoist physique.

34:50.590 --> 34:51.440
If you don't cultivate immortality,

34:51.440 --> 34:52.639
what do you want to do?

34:52.670 --> 34:55.469
I'll go to Yandu
to learn how to build dragon boats.

34:56.230 --> 34:58.690
What's there to learn
about building boats?

34:58.760 --> 34:59.820
Don't you think so?

35:01.630 --> 35:02.630
This silly child.

35:02.800 --> 35:03.860
Home-brewed wine!

35:04.360 --> 35:05.400
Stop wandering around.
It's time for boarding.

35:05.400 --> 35:05.960
Hurry up.

35:05.980 --> 35:10.220
[Zhoudu Pier]

35:30.910 --> 35:32.310
Are you going to Yanzhou?

35:45.150 --> 35:45.670
Yes.

35:46.380 --> 35:47.800
Didn't you say
you were sailing to Xiangzhou?

35:47.800 --> 35:48.510
Yes.

35:48.960 --> 35:50.110
I go wherever I want.

35:50.360 --> 35:51.890
It's none of your business.

35:52.070 --> 35:52.590
Sir,

35:53.150 --> 35:54.410
please board the ship.

36:05.510 --> 36:05.960
Here.

36:06.840 --> 36:08.510
What are you going to Yanzhou for, sir?

36:08.510 --> 36:09.510
Visiting relatives and friends,

36:09.510 --> 36:10.570
or doing business?

36:11.230 --> 36:12.630
Yanzhou is a great place.

36:13.000 --> 36:13.920
No extreme heat in summer,

36:13.920 --> 36:15.230
and no severe cold in winter.

36:15.230 --> 36:16.320
The Rice Noodles with Lamb there

36:16.320 --> 36:17.580
are known far and wide.

36:17.920 --> 36:19.480
As for the scenery of Lake Boyang,

36:19.480 --> 36:21.550
it's like a view from heaven.

36:22.400 --> 36:23.600
Are we leaving or not?

36:24.960 --> 36:25.760
We're leaving.

36:25.760 --> 36:27.160
We're leaving right now.

36:50.110 --> 36:50.670
Sir.

36:51.960 --> 36:53.400
My boat is small and profits are low.

36:53.400 --> 36:54.880
Can I take another passenger

36:54.880 --> 36:55.880
to earn a bit more?

36:59.230 --> 36:59.760
Miss!

37:00.110 --> 37:01.500
Are you going to Yanzhou?

37:01.500 --> 37:04.230
There's great food
and beautiful scenery there!

37:07.110 --> 37:08.110
Chu Ying?

37:12.440 --> 37:13.640
Are we leaving or not?

37:20.680 --> 37:24.690
♪ Caught in fate's design,
I search my soul ♪

37:25.070 --> 37:28.050
♪ What should I do to avoid
living my life in vain? ♪

37:28.070 --> 37:29.790
♪ My blade stays clean,
untouched by dust ♪

37:29.820 --> 37:33.790
♪ Yet it's sparked thousands of wars ♪

37:35.970 --> 37:39.010
♪ Even if it's soul-eroding,
collarbone-binding pain, I accept it all ♪

37:39.540 --> 37:42.840
♪ Embracing pain as home,
reborn like a phoenix ♪

37:43.350 --> 37:49.410
♪ Just to trade the rest of my days
for one true life as a human ♪

37:50.360 --> 37:54.030
♪ Let strong wine carry me into
drunken nights till midnight ♪

37:54.130 --> 37:57.190
♪ Let my soul blaze in brilliant colors ♪

37:57.220 --> 38:00.050
♪ Let the agony of a thousand cuts ♪

38:00.070 --> 38:04.660
♪ Stand as proof that I have lived ♪

38:02.360 --> 38:02.840
Miss,

38:03.400 --> 38:04.200
are you going?

38:04.480 --> 38:05.000
Yes.

38:04.960 --> 38:08.560
♪ Let me taste a life of flesh and blood
in full ♪

38:06.150 --> 38:06.750
I'm going!

38:08.580 --> 38:11.740
♪ Let me savor the many flavors
of the mortal world ♪

38:11.940 --> 38:13.760
♪ Let me face the world's
warmth and cold alike ♪

38:13.790 --> 38:19.130
♪ To live and perish with it,
daring to go mad, daring to dream ♪

38:19.150 --> 38:24.860
♪ Don't live in vain,
have a pleasant journey of life ♪

38:19.590 --> 38:20.960
If you really can't accept it,

38:20.960 --> 38:22.280
how about 3 taels of silver?

38:22.280 --> 38:22.920
For 3 taels of silver,

38:22.920 --> 38:24.630
I'll let you become an immortal.

38:24.630 --> 38:25.710
An immortal!

38:27.800 --> 38:28.400
Master.

38:32.110 --> 38:32.750
Your child

38:32.750 --> 38:33.880
can't tell good from bad.

38:33.880 --> 38:34.920
Listen to me.

38:35.150 --> 38:36.320
Don't go to Yandu.

38:36.630 --> 38:37.760
Take him to

38:37.760 --> 38:39.630
cultivate immortality at Lingji Mountain.

38:39.630 --> 38:40.290
Otherwise,

38:40.630 --> 38:41.400
it'd be a waste of

38:41.400 --> 38:42.480
his talent.

38:43.070 --> 38:43.670
Master,

38:43.800 --> 38:44.840
he is a swindler.

38:45.400 --> 38:46.330
You little brat.

38:46.470 --> 38:48.310
He said the prophecy was wrong.

38:48.590 --> 38:50.440
The Heavenly Talent born on September 9th

38:50.440 --> 38:51.810
is not the savior of the world.

38:51.810 --> 38:53.190
The one born on August 16th is.

38:53.190 --> 38:54.320
That's the truth.

38:55.070 --> 38:55.840
He is right.

38:57.520 --> 38:58.480
Exactly.

38:58.510 --> 39:00.070
People born on September 9th

39:00.070 --> 39:01.470
are saviors of the world.

39:01.510 --> 39:02.910
Those born on August 16th

39:02.960 --> 39:04.620
are also saviors of the world.

39:04.880 --> 39:06.010
Those born on May 4th

39:06.110 --> 39:06.880
and March 2nd

39:07.480 --> 39:09.080
are all saviors of the world.

39:12.670 --> 39:14.800
Among all living beings in this world,

39:14.960 --> 39:16.620
as long as you choose justice,

39:16.840 --> 39:18.320
shoulder responsibilities,

39:18.320 --> 39:20.630
stay true to yourself,
and believe in yourself,

39:20.630 --> 39:23.280
you can be a savior of the world.

39:34.840 --> 39:35.320
You...

39:38.320 --> 39:39.800
Crazy Taoist?

39:56.070 --> 39:59.700
[The End]
